        "node_id": "n_7_db4ada",
        "thought_text": "Re-evaluate the logic inside the if condition to ensure that each monster is counted only once across all heroes. Adjust the calculation of `total` to account for the maximum number of monsters that can be defeated by any hero, rather than adding up individual counts within the loop.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "4194249448928181839",
